title: The Council of the Works
subtitle: The factory councils lead the strike. Who leads the councils?
view-if: crisis_cuno = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.cunoTick(Q.crisis_time + 1);
!}
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= The Council of the Works

The assembly of Berlin's factory councils sits day and night in the union hall on the Engelufer. Our members are the largest group, not a majority. The Social Democratic and non-party delegates want the strike to stay a strike.

- @joint: Elect a joint strike committee with the SPD delegates.
- @guard: Put the hundreds at the council's disposal.
- @congress: Call a national congress of factory councils.

@joint
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] The Social Democratic strikers stay out longer.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids a joint committee with the SPD.
on-arrival: {!
RG.e22.against('united_front');
Q.e23_cuno_endurance += 10;
Q.e23_cuno_pressure += 3;
Q.spd_relation += 4;
RG.e22.cunoLines();
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

A strike committee of fifteen is elected, seven of them Social Democrats. Their executive disowns them, and they stay.

@guard
subtitle: The police keep their distance. The moderates are frightened.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district('berlin', {guards: 1, repression: 3});
Q.e23_cuno_pressure += 8;
Q.e23_cuno_endurance -= 3;
Q.spd_relation -= 2;
RG.e22.cunoLines();
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}

Grey windcheaters appear at the doors of the power stations and the council hall.

@congress
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. A national body of the councils that may outlast the strike.
view-if: e23_council_congress = 0
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no money to bring the delegates.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.e23_council_congress = 1;
Q.e23_cuno_pressure += 5;
RG.e22.cunoLines();
Q.lean_ultraleft += 1;
!}

Delegates from three hundred works arrive by lorry and bicycle and elect a national committee of the factory councils. The union federation declares it illegitimate.
